<view class="flow-page"><text class="flow-title">保存训练记录</text><text class="flow-muted">按真实练习填写，跟练与手动记录共用进度。</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="flow-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!session}}" class="flow-card"><text class="flow-label">实际训练日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="chooseDate"><view class="flow-input">{{date}}</view></picker><text class="flow-label">选择计划</text><picker range="{{plans}}" range-key="name" value="{{planIndex}}" bindchange="choosePlan"><view class="flow-input">{{plans[planIndex].name || '请先创建计划'}}</view></picker><text class="flow-muted">补记真实训练不消耗松果。</text><button class="flow-button" bindtap="begin">填写实际完成量</button></view><block wx:if="{{selected}}"><view class="flow-tabs"><text wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="cardId" data-id="{{item.cardId}}" bindtap="selectRow" class="{{card === item.cardId ? 'flow-selected' : ''}}">{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="flow-card"><text class="flow-heading">{{selected.name}}</text><text class="flow-pill">本次要求 {{selected.dose}}</text><text class="flow-muted">训练日期：{{date}}</text><view wx:for="{{values}}" wx:key="index" class="flow-task"><text>第 {{index + 1}} 组</text><input class="flow-input flow-flex" type="number" value="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="未完成可留空" /><text>{{selected.unit}}</text></view><button class="flow-button flow-secondary" bindtap="addGroup">＋ 添加实际完成量</button><text class="flow-small">空白表示未记录；实际量达到当时要求的所有组，才显示全部完成。</text><button class="flow-button flow-secondary" bindtap="fillAll">按本次要求填写全部组（请本人确认）</button><text class="flow-label">今天的感受（选填）</text><textarea class="flow-input" value="{{notes}}" bindinput="inputNotes" maxlength="1000" placeholder="想记下的练习感受" /><text class="flow-pill">已保存状态：{{statusText}}</text><button class="flow-button" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存实际完成量</button><button class="flow-button flow-secondary" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="continueTraining">保存后继续训练</button></view></block></view>
